+// 罗德岛 MOD summons (tools/local-extract/build-rhodes-mod.mjs; docs/MOD-RHODES.md)
+//
+// The 卫戍协议 season never shipped 凯尔希·思衡托 / Mon3tr / 可露希尔, so their summons had no records and the mod
